{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4388107989b1fed14a1ae90eca153d6043068d8acac8667eaf0574e0f5c17102", "ja": "できることも、できないことも", "zh": "能做到的事，还有做不到的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ef279d3111426e52474df9f319f72f3aac50da8808b29a5dec21bea71863b8a2", "ja": "ミニライブ当日。前の現場が押して到着が遅\nれる真と響。千早とあずさは二人だけで先に\n出ることになるが、二人は完璧に場を繋ぐ。\nそんな二人を見た真は、ダンスだけでなく、\n歌でも千早とあずさを追い越すと宣言する。", "zh": "迷你演唱会当天。由于前一个工作现场超时，真和响赶到时晚了。千早和梓只能先由两人登台，但她们完美地撑住了场面。看到这样的两人，真宣言说，自己不仅要在舞蹈上，还要在歌唱上超越千早和梓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9995ef2bb95aec5ce642e452637a33f62a159a19e01372c4cbc858aa055aeb9e", "ja": "（いよいよミニライブ当日。もうすぐ本番だけど、\n真と響は前の現場が押して、まだ到着していない……）", "zh": "（终于到了迷你演唱会当天。马上就要正式开始了，可真和响因为前一个工作拖延，到现在还没赶到……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a376607d6c4f0ae3a8333b17c1f743327965b5e4012c7060de894a1c6f58a5c7", "ja": "あ、もしもし？\n真、響。今どんな状況だ？", "zh": "啊，喂？\n真、响，你们现在情况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "63d4df46f1d8d53dd25b80faa064e5851bba11c168a0def94490c5768ef793d9", "ja": "すみません！　タクシーはすぐ捕まえられたんですけど\n今度は事故渋滞に巻き込まれちゃったみたいで……！", "zh": "对不起！虽然很快就拦到出租车了，可这次好像又遇上了事故造成的堵车……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "5f42833fe7cd343082ae0ee1013cd2b2751e208c5d2a2a2d9e8a0cf62448ff13", "ja": "ううっ、ごめん{$P$}！\n千早もあずささんも！　こんな時に、こんな時に～！！", "zh": "呜呜，对不起，{$P$}！\n千早和梓小姐也是！偏偏在这种时候，偏偏在这种时候——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "132fb2972400af014122089e8f661a3873eecff7b923e2d81ed0c927474b66d2", "ja": "気にするな、仕方ない！　こっちこそ、\nきついスケジュールで回してごめんな？", "zh": "别在意，没办法！反倒是我才该道歉，安排这么紧的日程让你们赶行程，对不起啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "9a1369f785a286acd00beb7b637d65f99ae9435a5b92d368ad59c13b3477becc", "ja": "真、我那覇さん。こっちは大丈夫だから。\nふたりが来るまで、お客さんは……誰も帰さない。", "zh": "真、我那霸小姐。这边没问题。  \n在你们两个来之前，观众……一个都不会离开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "6176b39069ae4db0870a5245dbc7978e9b5a0b5cff576ba334bd35393530a0c2", "ja": "千早……。\nうん、お願い！", "zh": "千早……\n嗯，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "369a116e6dcecf733de6208439333433cc89b09394dc826df9812fadf26730d6", "ja": "焦らなくていいから、二人とも気をつけてね。\nお客さんと千早ちゃんと一緒に、ずっと待ってるわ。", "zh": "不用着急，你们两个都要小心哦。\n我会和客人以及千早一起，一直等着你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "b138ace1f28a73f5b1408d3cc7d35cb6aa481f7d12490ef253b8c241d37a5b19", "ja": "あずささん……、うんっ！\n焦らないで急いで行くから。絶対待っててね！", "zh": "秋月阿姨……嗯！\n我会不慌不忙地赶过去的。一定要等着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1009_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1010_staff", "source_sha256": "d06f68589eec6c6cf7bc77f6c9fd795d7a126c240a47fb1795db9f93ed7c1710", "ja": "765プロさん、そろそろスタンバイお願いします！", "zh": "765事务所各位，差不多请准备就位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "da13ee858b8716197bf28f5d54a1e8b6f42ec6d2bb965a4659caca04aa0dc932", "ja": "あ、はい……！\nじゃあ、千早、あずささん。", "zh": "啊，好的……！\n那么，千早、秋月前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "b0a5bb1ad928a90aa2a7eca146d6f25a58d01ffcebda52fffe2a83c6c3f4827b", "ja": "はい。レッスンを信じて、二人のぶんまで\n歌って、踊るつもりで……。行ってきます！", "zh": "好的。我会相信训练，连同你们两人的份一起歌唱、起舞……我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "85f360c97a6384d13c40e4c87042ecb3e974a4e2fcd2ca9b16a569aa9befa321", "ja": "ええ、二人のぶんも、大きく、広く……。\n頑張りましょう！", "zh": "是的，也要连同两个人的份，一起唱得更响亮、更广阔……  \n加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "59dadf518be91e716e36afebd76c3903b55fa8629093d98989bf31a45de71585", "ja": "（ミニライブが始まった。千早とあずささんの歌声に、\n一瞬で会場が飲まれる……）", "zh": "（迷你演唱会开始了。千早和あずさ小姐的歌声，让会场瞬间沉浸其中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "05aeec0e0d162d65da75d31cd1b616ba7fe9d123792b129c236008090c64d79e", "ja": "（いや、歌だけじゃない、ダンスも……！\n寸分の狂いもない、完璧なパフォーマンスだ！）", "zh": "（不，不只是歌声，舞蹈也是……！\n这是毫无半点偏差的完美表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "369921305475ab4f460226f9ae6a4e2aa5071f833387746500c6957904a23580", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nみなさん、いかがでしたか？", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……\n大家觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1018_audience", "source_sha256": "d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "25142b8ef3997d047f947df7be581b0a2d48e556f10811c8d2ade9e55cad6947", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、ありがとうございます～。\n楽しんでいただけて、安心しました。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊，谢谢您～  \n您能享受其中，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "3c8da3003b832d5b59d7d59e1b77c192815284dde6b75b150a65d8a279f74a20", "ja": "では、次の曲に……、え？", "zh": "那么，接下来是下一首歌……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "c2eaf1c54f985f9c569c5af90a3492429d335c0589000e5f9917749890da103e", "ja": "みんなー！　遅れてごめーん！", "zh": "大家——！对不起我迟到了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "5ac003ee71a5015d420bfc7fea7c52e4193a674087cb1f8933fff3f00705ceaa", "ja": "お待たせ～！　やっと着いたぞ～！", "zh": "让大家久等了～！终于到了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "a91632c4f2561bbcb22ef111763eb46e6e89e9c8f3fbe3f71a27cc8077c58104", "ja": "真、我那覇さん……！", "zh": "真、我那霸小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1024_audience", "source_sha256": "d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "2bac6c4af8c9dadefb4ad37259c51ecaf9a2adfe47eebd98b8516214151b71a8", "ja": "二人ともお疲れさま！　よかった、もしかして\n道に迷ったのかな～って思い始めていたの！", "zh": "两位辛苦了！太好了，我刚开始还在想，你们该不会是迷路了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "d8a45a14cbc2c6a2c8890c2c4fb8a44aa3f7262dc91b4bd07951f7d0886886b0", "ja": "そ、そうですか、でもタクシーなのでそれは……\nとにかく、すみませんでした！", "zh": "这、这样啊，不过我们是坐出租车来的，所以不至于迷路……\n总之，真的很抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "5fed7b8ef1ad6a6e5f0ddd594c758df96d88a72dff9d91143d6d139fe87990b7", "ja": "よーし、それじゃあ！　……みんなーっ！\n盛り上がってたみたいだけど、まだ元気残ってる～！？", "zh": "好——嘞，那么！……大家——！\n刚才好像气氛就很热烈了，现在还有力气吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1028_audience", "source_sha256": "db0d21c596375ea2d058aa090583e89b7c3086f18072c6148341062d0de45e5f", "ja": "ワアアアアアーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "5f3ec080a828eea26066d0d02a9c7e8b70abf293befd6074ea157fe6792ff58c", "ja": "そう来なくっちゃ！\nそれじゃあ、いっくよーーー！！", "zh": "就是要这样才对！\n那我要上咯——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1030_audience", "source_sha256": "e164b7a129efaeace3127b58988443165329b31828d55b374c1a021c23e1934d", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "94db5f68071d8ec8a98157510038190dd44cdf093bbbea71a4bc5bf95dcd248a", "ja": "ふう～……。いやあ、終わってみれば、\nサイッコーのミニライブでしたね！", "zh": "呼——……哎呀，回过头来看，这真是一场最棒的迷你演唱会呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "6d11f6951054af9f199a385874105fe3ecf6933fb1e22aa63205a280bcb5f5c1", "ja": "結果的には、ドラマチックな展開になったしな。\n最初はやっぱり、二人いない影響があったんだけど……", "zh": "结果看来，事情发展得还挺戏剧性的。刚开始果然还是受了少了两个人的影响，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1c885457fc6a7057540040644c025343690784e7e9607c64cd2343352a998b48", "ja": "それも千早とあずささんのパフォーマンスで、すぐ取り\n戻したんだ。歌はもちろんだけど、ダンスが凄かった！", "zh": "不过，千早和梓小姐的表演很快就弥补了这一点。歌唱自不必说，舞蹈也太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "12303f8c45c885bc12597a53532bf0e5692bba2fbfd5c88d5270744c70c7e649", "ja": "ふふっ、居残りレッスンした甲斐がありました。\nね、千早ちゃん♪", "zh": "呵呵，这下没白加练。对吧，千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "5e94342a8b7d6ab7bead1ff99ac04bf28eb069da09ad5e1b78c90870782a2eaa", "ja": "はい。きっと、レッスンで二人の動きを\n何度も見た成果かと。", "zh": "是的，这一定是因为在练习中反复观察了两个人的动作，才有这样的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "eccd72f8b68db434a2be7a8c52f6a3279e6abd6be0a1c8ba42e5884a59125eff", "ja": "ボクたちが着いた時も、\nすっごく盛り上がってたもんね！", "zh": "我们到的时候，现场也正热闹着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "424a923b3446d2de7a02b14d9c65f8958781fb728d0ec7367242b04b7a48375b", "ja": "そこからの二人のダンスも凄かったさー。\n自分、本気で負けるかと思っちゃったぞ！", "zh": "从那之后你们俩的舞蹈也很精彩啦——\n我都差点以为自己真的要输了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "7335da63caf784defa17da83c4a8cc2f1e738cb7361484bd9c2f41801c8ff503", "ja": "それは言い過ぎよ、我那覇さん。\nそこまでではないハズ……。", "zh": "那也说得太夸张了，我那霸。\n应该还没到那种程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "a4e480c262ce2a33d5c47c708406692e25b94cf97d637ba5ace68daa5dcb27fe", "ja": "……あ。そっか。", "zh": "……啊。原来是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "14cebb1878acc5bff2644c8472b7082694a9aa4331040334e66d9eba7f13a6fc", "ja": "真？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "真的？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb72c2c522ff791d383b63a80dfe207c8a773192cd883e6ca6532ec39e5f73d7", "ja": "あ、いえ……。なんていうか。\n今回、最初から……。", "zh": "啊，不是……该怎么说呢。\n这次，从一开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "9d9217e892aa3825ec70b688201b4a7569893d863a2e5346fa9e40dede64cb04", "ja": "歌は千早とあずささん、ダンスは響とボク。\nそんなイメージがあったと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "我觉得，当时好像有这样的印象……唱歌是千早和あずさ，跳舞是响和我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "2964b8a72cd489ccad12e7aa69633e1d9a84b253664cbf1cc14c11ac9e56a7a2", "ja": "それって、思いこみっていうか。\nいつの間にか、挑戦してなかったんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "那算是一种先入为主吧。\n不知不觉间，我们是不是没有去挑战呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1044_002chi", "source_sha256": "cea3957c3dc65429de8756c2f3fcecbf63099921ac921a4631143dfdd77b9aa6", "ja": "真……。", "zh": "真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1045_006mak", "source_sha256": "18562c09f3bd6ffcf1bc2e18c2a7ccdcc238e0c235b5c7e28af7c2f81605264d", "ja": "もちろん、歌から逃げてたわけじゃないですよ？\nただ、勝負は得意なとこでっていう意識はあって。", "zh": "我也不是在逃避唱歌哦？\n只是总想着要在自己擅长的地方决胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1046_006mak", "source_sha256": "ac503d7c95640b35dca0f0d22eaa69d3631a89a02d3771ebca6c93d90421c036", "ja": "それって……いいのかな……？", "zh": "这样……真的好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ae2e44bd1498210c4c61da430fd90901e34cf543476b7305bce951bfd0369563", "ja": "……そうだな、自分の長所を活かして、\nそこで勝負するのは、いいことだと思う。", "zh": "……也是啊，发挥自己的长处，\n以此去决胜负，我认为是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "1260a25bcb982a651814c886f6e83a66f65ab1b432b2af33e921f65d0e2a138b", "ja": "でも、それ以外のことには、自分で\n限界を作ってしまっていたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "不过，在其他方面，或许是自己给自己设下了界限。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "b242a481a7b67b78908ddb88fe4f67145732098017278d43dcc0a3d16672f5f7", "ja": "あ、そう、それです！　千早もあずささんも、今回\nボクと響が驚くくらいのダンスを見せてくれたんです。", "zh": "啊，对，就是这个！千早和梓小姐这次都展现出了让连我和响都惊讶的舞蹈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1050_013hib", "source_sha256": "40a9c61e6fd6571752ce6eff5b1610eca2a9e87c98ac137b085818fee93f99a1", "ja": "そっか。なら自分も、千早とあずささんが\nビックリするぐらいの歌を歌わないと！", "zh": "这样啊。那我也得唱出让千早和あずさ小姐大吃一惊的歌才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1051_p", "source_sha256": "d56598676f4ff4eb702d52456e716366086e231d8932e77ca98d5cdfa5c422f8", "ja": "……そうだな。歌で、千早とあずささんに勝つ。\nダンスで真と響に勝つ。それはとても難しい事だけど…", "zh": "……是啊。在歌唱上赢过千早和梓小姐，\n在舞蹈上赢过真和响。虽然这确实非常困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "66eb0a6680f656890a093009e2a39473f79abbe6795a4a106f01fe05caafc1c9", "ja": "追いかけないと、絶対に近づくこともない。\nまずは、本気で追い越すつもりで追いかけないとな！", "zh": "如果不去追，就绝对不可能接近目标。\n首先得抱着认真超越对方的决心去追才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "e2f5014ab275b89ef08d78c947f0ec89fa8adb1f0af251b1274601e9313e02f5", "ja": "ですよね！　でないと、ボクもいつまでも、\n普通のボクのまま……。ボクを越えられないですよね！", "zh": "就是啊！不然的话，我也会一直停留在普通的自己……那样就无法超越自己了，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1054_006mak", "source_sha256": "42e2f0e17d15f4af6713ff63c60be1437e535a2848efa6ca2a262a56140fca2a", "ja": "よし、決めました！　ボク、これからは歌で、\n千早やあずささんを追い越してみせます！", "zh": "好，决定了！从今以后，我要用歌声超越千早和梓小姐给你们看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1055_013hib", "source_sha256": "db90a7878833010a99f79e1b912c03fa3220e158e9fdd64128a8ddd152fad7ff", "ja": "じゃあ、自分はその真を追い越すぞ！\nそのまま、765プロのみんなをゴボウ抜きさー！", "zh": "那我就要超越那个真！然后把765事务所的大家一个接一个全都超越啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1056_002chi", "source_sha256": "49a6104df4a551e2f0cacedbee7384f0f3162c91c011b0f44206c6bb40f99ea0", "ja": "……悪いけれど、私もただ追い越されるのを\n待ってはいないわ。真にも我那覇さんにも……誰にも。", "zh": "……抱歉，我也不会只是\n干等着被超过去的。无论是真、我那霸同学……还是任何人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_05_1057_010azu", "source_sha256": "4255361170cad2af5a02c119e2ea707d1d219f82a920d5c640b4a9ea2bac5c67", "ja": "もう、みんな頑張り屋さんね。\n私も追いつけるように、頑張ります♪", "zh": "大家都很努力呢。\n我也会努力追上大家的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
